---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Terms of Service · PuzzleSecret" description="Terms of service and digital reward distribution rules for PuzzleSecret.">
  <main class="page-legal">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="eyebrow">Legal &amp; Terms</p>
      <h1>Terms of Service</h1>
      <p class="last-up">Last updated: July 25, 2026</p>

      <div class="legal-content">
        <h2>1. Terms Acceptance</h2>
        <p>By accessing and using PuzzleSecret.com, you agree to comply with these Terms of Service. If you do not agree, please do not use the site.</p>

        <h2>2. Vault Rewards &amp; Bonus Content</h2>
        <p>The bonus PDF puzzle packs and digital rewards provided through the 3D Vault Crawl are free companion bonus materials designed for readers who solve the ciphers in <em>Sudoku with a Secret</em>. They are digital bonus items, not prizes of chance or sweepstakes awards.</p>

        <h2>3. Intellectual Property</h2>
        <p>All puzzle designs, vector art, 3D graphics, character audio narration, and trademarked titles (including <em>Sudoku with a Secret</em> and <em>PuzzleSecret</em>) are the exclusive intellectual property of Dan Herlehy. Digital PDF bonus packs are provided for personal, non-commercial print-and-play use only.</p>

        <h2>4. Disclaimer &amp; Availability</h2>
        <p>PuzzleSecret.com is provided "as is" without warranties of any kind. While we endeavor to maintain 100% uptime for all web vaults, we do not guarantee uninterrupted server access.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>

  <style>
    .page-legal { padding-top: 90px; padding-bottom: 80px; }
    .wrap { max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 20px; }
    .eyebrow { font-family: var(--display); font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: .36em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--gold); margin-bottom: 12px; }
    .page-legal h1 { font-family: var(--display); font-size: 38px; color: var(--ivory); margin-bottom: 6px; }
    .last-up { font-style: italic; color: var(--ash-dim); font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 36px; }
    .legal-content h2 { font-family: var(--display); font-size: 20px; color: var(--gold); margin-top: 28px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
    .legal-content p { font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--ash); margin-bottom: 14px; }
  </style>
</Layout>
